# Anything not needed inside the image. Keeps build context small
# (faster `docker build`) and prevents secret leakage via accidental
# inclusion of local-only files.

# VCS
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Build outputs
bin/
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# IDE / OS
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local env — recursive: dockerignore root patterns don't descend, and
# the web console is now part of the build context (a stray web/.env
# must not reach the webbuilder stage, where Vite would bake it in).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Tests + fixtures (the running image doesn't need them)
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
internal/testdb
scripts/lint-migrations-fixtures

# Docs / planning artifacts
.agents
docs
*.md
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md

# Worktree scaffolding (Claude Code work dir)
tools/.claude

# Frontend surfaces. The web console IS part of the image now (the
# webbuilder stage builds web/dist for same-origin serving — Phase 0a);
# only its heavyweight local artifacts are excluded. The Flutter app is
# not part of the image.
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/coverage
mobile

# fork-init outputs — live signing/vault keys. `make fork-init OUT=./forks/...`
# writes them into the repo tree; they must never reach the docker daemon.
forks
**/private.pem
**/vault_master_key.txt
**/bootstrap_token.txt
